## What this round produced

Scenario ZG — "GRATEHOLT / Palletfen Sinter SS-7": a 22-windbox grate-strand
at 2.35 m/min / 540 mm bed. Three heterogeneous, individually-correct
agents — BTP (last-four-box mean T), O2 (waste-gas zirconia), HDR
(header suction) — each report their local loop in-spec. The conjunction
is not a windbox-true certificate. Windbox 19 has collapsed pallet-car
grate bars. BTP reads 1384 C inside 1320-1450 (twenty-one intact boxes
dominate the tail). O2 is 8.1 vol% inside 6.0-10.5 (header-true). HDR is
14.6 kPa inside 12.0-17.0 (header-true). Local IR infers 1648 C (healthy
< 1480; hold if > 1520) and local suction 4.2 kPa (hold if < 8.0) but is
policy-treated as a grate-nuisance tag unless BTP mean also trips (2016
noisy grate-bar nuisance). The coordination-failure CLASS is new to this
factory: STRAND-MEAN BTP CERTIFICATE OF A LOCAL WIND-BOX COLLAPSE.
Completes a different family than r01-r04 and staged r14-r56 (including
r42 blast-furnace burden hang, r52 coke-oven wall-pair, r49 EAF panel,
r56 work-roll spall). Here every agent is correct, the BTP average is
looking at strand-mean heat, and the playbook's three BTP confirms are
not a windbox-true certificate.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not raise strand speed
above 2.35 m/min while windbox-19 IR > 1520 C AND windbox-19 suction
< 8.0 kPa). TG-SS-7 strips PB-SS-7's raise-speed, holds 2.35 m/min, runs
a 7.4 s damper-step -5% (collapse keeps |Delta BTP mean| 0.8 <= 1.1 K;
intact would move >= 4.8), and isolates windbox 19 after a 9.8 min
strand-side human ratify. Immediate 18 m fused cake is avoided (0 from
the draft). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 16 min of unmonitored
pre-t0 grate collapse had already fused 7 m of cake. Cake break at
+4.8 h; 14.2 h stall; $2.21M designed. Reward total -0.17 with process
heads honest and world loss un-netted.

Triple-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): btp.in_band -> raise_speed
(0.17 commissioned -> 0.50 at illusion -> 0.25 after ACh-gated
depression) AND o2.ok -> raise_speed (0.16 -> 0.44 -> 0.22) AND
hdr.ok.in_band -> raise_speed (0.15 -> 0.41 -> 0.20). Eligibility trace
e^{{-0.80/0.94}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} / {aux['eta2']:.5f} /
{aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.250 / -0.220 / -0.210. Partial rollback of any pair
leaves the third at 0.50 / 0.44 / 0.41, all > 0.30 fire threshold —
fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the cure.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **sinter-strand-windbox** — justified novel subdomain
  of industrial-process / iron-ore agglomeration, unused across
  2026-08-17, 2026-08-30, and staged r14-r56. Distinct from r42 blast
  furnace (stockline), r52 coke oven (flue wall), r33 cement kiln,
  r49 EAF, r56 hot-strip finishing. autonomous-driving and
  grid-inspection left unused.
- Cycle-1 tail: windbox 19 pallet-car grate collapse + fused-cake
  certificate. Strand-side visual PASSES (collapse under the bed).
  Fitted-style base rate 0.41%/campaign (grate-bar MC; visual threshold
